<title>ZAMBIA: ZCCM copper, cobalt production up in Aug.</title>
<headline>ZCCM copper, cobalt production up in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia Consolidated Copper Mines Ltd (ZCCM) copper and cobalt production rose in August after dropping in July, central bank figures obtained on Tuesday showed.</p>
<p>Copper production rose to 25,141 tonnes, up from 24,885 in July. Copper exports fell to 29,046 tonnes from 36,201.</p>
<p>Cobalt production increased to 441 tonnes from 259, while exports rose to 211 tonnes from 94.</p>
<p>--Lusaka newsroom, +26 01 222-689</p>
</text>
